 "strings": {
  "All right. You're at least trying to take this seriously, so give me the club's name and let's be done with this.": "",
  "Oh, great! Thanks, man!": "",
  "You're not doing this because you're low on money, are you?": "",
  "Nah, this has nothing do with money. My family's actually pretty well-off.": "",
  "Besides, there are bigger, more bodacious issues at stake here.": "",
  "I'm curious about this \"issue\" of yours...": "",
  "I'll save those details for later. First, let me introduce you to the finest young hostess that Kamurocho has to offer!": "",
  "She's innocent, she's lovable, and she has a good heart... And to top it all off, your first visit's on me!": "",
  "You'd go that far just to get me into your club?": "",
  "To get you to meet this girl? I'd practically do anything!": "",
  "Really really. In fact, I'll even let you order the most expensive drinks in the club, all on my tab.": "",
  "And you can afford all this... how?": "",
  "Dude. I make cash money on this job. I'm talking, like, 500,000 yen a month here.": "",
  "What!? You earn <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind> much just pestering pedestrians about breasts!? I had no idea barkers could be so loaded...": "",
  "Yes sir. This job is all about results. Oh, and just between you and me...": "",
  "The trick is to come up with as many euphemisms for boobs as you can. Heh heh... Guys just eat that shit up!": "",
  "...That actually works? How many do you have?": "",
  "Well, there's jugs, jigglers, jumbos, bosoms, bigguns, bazongas, love bubbles, blouse biscuits... Should I keep going?": "",
  "That was... more than I ever needed to hear.": "",
  "Righteous. Anyway, what I want you to do is head to Apple Pie over on Tenkaichi Street and ask for a girl named Madoka.": "",
  "Okay, Madoka-san it is.": "",
  "Right. Also, tell whoever's on duty there that I'll be footing the bill.": "",
  "I'll be chilling at the smoking area inside Kamuro Theater, so let me know how it goes when you're done.": "",
  "Okay, will do.": "",
  "Yosuke-kun, I went to visit Madoka-chan.": "",
  "And? How was she?": "",
  "Yeah, so she didn't seem like the hostess type at all. I wonder if she'll be okay over there.": "",
  "Did she flinch or start crying when you touched her? Or did she maybe... slap you in the face?": "",
  "What, no! I didn't lay a finger on her, man. That's not my style.": "",
  "Really!? Yagami-san, you're... such a good guy! I knew I could count on you!": "",
  "Wait, what's going on here? You set me up to go out with a student, and now you're happy we didn't do anything?": "",
  "Whoa. She actually told you she was a student? Man... I'm impressed! ": "",
  "Damn, that's nothing short of a miracle!": "",
  "Yeah, I've brought in my fair share of customers, but you're the first she's opened up to.": "",
  "See, Madoka-chan rarely talks to anyone at work, and I doubt she'd tell anyone about her personal life.": "",
  "That's what they said at the club, too...": "",
  "Yosuke-kun. Who is Madoka-chan to you, anyway? You were saying there was some kind of reason behind all this.": "",
  "Hmm. You seem like a trustworthy guy. Okay, I'll spill the beans.": "",
  "So, Madoka-chan was actually my senior in high school.": "",
  "She was really... popular because of her huge chest, so we all teased her by calling her \"Madonkadonk.\" You know, like, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>badonkadonks</font_kind>?": "",
  "I thought that word meant \"ass.\"": "",
  "Yeah, well, it was close enough. And besides, it's not like she knew the difference.": "",
  "Anyway, Madonkadonk got me through some really <font_kind=yakuza_italic>hard times</font_kind>... if you know what I mean.": "",
  "That's more than I cared to know, Yosuke.": "",
  "No! That's not what I was saying at all! I would never think of her like that, despite the phenomenal size of her melons.": "",
  "I meant that she used to look after me. We were in the same academic club, so we spent a lot of time together.": "",
  "And when I was about to get held back a grade, she intervened by helping me with my schoolwork. I really owe her a lot.": "",
  "So that's why you're so hell-bent on helping her. She sounds like a really caring person.": "",
  "She is. Only thing is, she's not super sociable, and she couldn't hold a conversation with a mirror.": "",
  "That's why she doesn't get too many customers, even though she has to pay for her tuition and who knows what else.": "",
  "So, I came up with a plan to bring in harmless-looking guys and get them to request her!": "",
  "Ah, now I get it. Then why don't you support her with all the money you've been making?": "",
  "No, there's no way I could damage her sense of pride. Madonkadonk was never really one to accept charity.": "",
  "She'd probably say something like, \"Don't worry about it, Yosuke-kun. I can get by on my own.\"": "",
  "I understand. Does she know you're working as a barker?": "",
  "Nope, I'm just cheering her on from the sidelines.": "",
  "Now that you know all this, would you maybe pay her a visit on your own? And spend a lot of money on her?": "",
  "And, and... if you have any harmless friends, could you send them my way so I can introduce them to her?": "",
  "Well, okay. I'll at least give it some thought.": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san. Are you interested in being bombarded with boobage?": "",
  "Or perhaps you've found a trustworthy companion who won't do anything too naughty?": "",
  "Hmm... Do I even know any guys like that?": "",
  "Oh, what about... Kaito-san?": "",
  "Nah, I bet he's an animal with the ladies. He'd totally try to cop a feel... In fact, he'd probably try for more.": "",
  "Please, no! I wouldn't want anyone like that even <font_kind=yakuza_italic>near</font_kind> Madoka-chan!": "",
  "Yeah, you're right. Okay, who else...": "",
  "Hoshino-kun? ...Wait, that won't work. If Saori-san found out, she'd never speak to either of us again.": "",
  "It's probably a good idea to find someone who can keep this whole thing discreet.": "",
  "I'm sure Genda-sensei could use a break every now and then...": "",
  "...Or not. I don't want to imagine the look on his face in front of a pair of... what Madoka-chan has.": "",
  "Sorry, I can't really think of anyone.": "",
  "Ah, I see. So you only have perverted friends, then?": "",
  "Not exactly, but... Hmm. Maybe you're right.": "",
  "If that's the case, then let me know if you make any trustworthy comrades who can help our mission succeed.": "",
  "Hey, would a ninja be allowed in your club?": "",
  "What!? A <font_kind=yakuza_italic>ninja</font_kind>!?": "",
  "Well... It doesn't exactly say in the rulebook that ninjas <font_kind=yakuza_italic>aren't</font_kind> allowed in the club...": "",
  "Do you actually have a ninja as a friend?": "",
  "Yeah, kinda. Let me give him a call.": "",
  "Hey, Ryan. Sorry for calling you out of nowhere like this.": "",
  "No need to apologize. For where my master walks in broad daylight, his pupil treads silently in the shadows.": "",
  "...Right. Just don't go doing anything shady while you're in there, okay?": "",
  "Hm-hm-hmm! Be not afraid, my yang to my yin! For a true ninja follows the path of abstinence!": "",
  "\"Clear the mind of mundane thoughts and even fire will become cool to the touch.\" Or so the saying goes.": "",
  "Hiyah!": "",
  "Uwaaa!": "",
  "\"Ryan-style Ninja Art: Illusion of Wrinkly Grandma\"! You see, by picturing my grandma, I remain limp as a lily flower!": "",
  "Wow... He really believes he's a ninja, doesn't he?": "",
  "Yeah. Guess that's why he says it all the time.": "",
  "Thanks for all your help, Yagami-san. Let me know if you find any more friends who are interested, okay?": "",
  "Hey Yosuke, your shift is almost over, right? Wanna grab some drinks?": "",
  "Ooh, sounds good! You buying?": "",
  "Hell no, you make way more than me, man! You should be the one offering.": "",
  "Whaaat? I'm not <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that</font_kind> generous...": "",
  "(I hope Ryan's not causing any trouble. Maybe I should check on him sometime.)": "",
  "Tanago seems like a pretty straightforward guy. Guess I'll hit him up... or at least try.": "",
  "Thanks for coming, Tanago.": "",
  "No problem! We're homies now, right?": "",
  "C'mon man. I'm Mr. Try and Hit Me, remember? I have a reputaton to uphold!": "",
  "If I was gonna flip out every time I caught a whiff of woman on the wind, I'd be behind bars right now!": "",
  "Uh... Okay?": "",
  "All right! Whether you're wide or narrow, busty or flat, Mr. Try and Hit Me respects your body image... And that's a fact!": "",
  "...Is this how he normally is?": "",
  "He's usually much worse.": "",
  "Excuse me, my good man! Let this thought sink into your brain: <font_kind=yakuza_italic>boooooobs</font_kind>.": "",
  "(Hope he's doing all right in there.)": "",
  "You know what? Tashiro-kun's a decent guy... surprisingly. I bet he'll be a good candidate.": "",
  "Did you just say... boobs?": "",
  "Oh yes. I've been saying <font_kind=yakuza_italic>boobs</font_kind> for quite a while now. Please, help yourself to some. No touching, though.": "",
  "...You fuckwit. You think you can just say <font_kind=yakuza_italic>boobs</font_kind> all the time and not sound like a total jackass!?": "",
  "The only people who can say <font_kind=yakuza_italic>boobs</font_kind> out in the open like this are mothers and their very young children! ...Dumbass.": "",
  "Wow, Tashiro-kun. You're way less inappropriate than I thought... sort of. So does this mean you're not going?": "",
  "Nah, I'll go. I'm not into this sort of thing, but if it can help someone else, I wouldn't mind lending a hand.": "",
  "Awesome. Just make sure you don't lend that hand down her blouse, okay? The boob community might frown upon that.": "",
  "I told you, stop saying stupid shit like that! Are you in middle school or something!?": "",
  "And it's not like I'm some kind of perv, either! Don't get it twisted!": "",
  "No one's accusing you, man. Just hurry up and get in there.": "",
  "A-All right. But remember, I'm doing you guys a favor, okay!?": "",
  "...You know. It's guys like him who deny it all the time that end up being the biggest pervs of all.": "",
  "Perhaps. But I don't think Tashiro-kun is the type to do anything bad.": "",
  "Greetings, friend! Would you care to see some sumptuous breasts today?": "",
  "(Hope Tashiro-kun is doing all right in there.)": "",
  "Hmm, if I recall... Ryo Suzaki turned out to be a pretty harmless guy. Unlike his younger twin.": "",
  "...So you want me to check out this hostess of yours, huh?": "",
  "Yes, but only with your eyes. Please refrain from touching her, however tempting it may be.": "",
  "Ahh... so she has a nice rack, huh? Reminds me of when I was little...": "",
  "My little bro and I... used to wrestle over who Mom would breastfeed first.": "",
  "He always did try and beat me to the teat, the little squirt... But he could never quite hold me down.": "",
  "Heh heh. We even have it on video. Ahh... simpler times, for sure.": "",
  "Yagami-san... I don't want to hear this. Is this really the time for a monologue?": "",
  "Sorry, man. Once he starts, that's it.": "",
  "Hey, snap out of it, man! Forget about the breasts of the past and focus on the breasts of the present!": "",
  "Breasts of the present, huh? Hmm... I never considered that.": "",
  "Well, there's a place you can have them all to yourself!": "",
  "...Long story short, boobs are the first thing a human being cries for.": "",
  "Can't argue with you there.": "",
  "Pardon me, but have you gotten your fill of breasts today? No? Then do I have the place for <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind>!": "",
  "Now listen here, Miss Madoka. In the world of ninjutsu, everything can be broken down into four natural elements.": "",
  "As such, each ninja is born with an elemental affinity. I, for one, am versed in escape arts that utilize fire magic.": "",
  "Oh, I... I see.": "",
  "(Looks like Ryan was perfect for the job.)": "",
  "Why am I not touching you? Because I know how it feels... My entire line of work is having people try and touch me.": "",
  "Yeah! Seriously, try and hit me! That's literally my name and my career. That way we'll both feel good.": "",
  "(I hope they don't charge him extra for this...)": "",
  "They're not just showpieces to throw out at any guy who comes your way. You can do better than this, Madoka.": "",
  "O-Oh... Okay... I'm sorry.": "",
  "(He's actually lecturing her...)": "",
  "So, Yosuke-kun. How's Madoka-chan doing at the club?": "",
  "Oh, Madonkadonk? Well, thanks to everyone's generous support, her sales have gone through the roof!": "",
  "Ah, good to hear.": "",
  "Hey, aren't you Yagami? I heard about you from Yosuke! Apparently you're pretty cool with Madoka over at Apple Pie.": "",
  "Huh? Yosuke, what's this guy talking about?": "",
  "Ahaha, well... He probably just got you mixed up. I'm sure there are plenty of other Yagamis walking around here.": "",
  "Anyway, make sure to take care of Madoka-chan. She's a real sweetheart, you know.": "",
  "(I'd rather not have a reputation among these people...)": "",
  "Yes... What...? Really...? No way, I don't believe this...! Madonkadonk is...? For sure...?": "",
  "(What's this about Madoka-chan?)": "",
  "Oh, hey, Yagami-san! Guess what just happened!": "",
  "Madonkadonk quit her job at the hostess club! Apparently she finally earned enough money.": "",
  "Oh, awesome! Guess all that hard work paid off.": "",
  "Yeah, well, we couldn't have done it if it wasn't for all your help. Thanks, man!": "",
  "No sweat. Does this mean you're finally gonna tell her you've been supporting her all along?": "",
  "No... It's better if I keep it a secret. I don't want her to feel disappointed in herself.": "",
  "Worst-case scenario, she'll try to give me back the money she earned. And that would be a waste.": "",
  "Gotcha. Well, as long as you're okay with it.": "",
  "By the way, are you gonna keep doing this job now that you've reached your goal?": "",
  "Hmm... You know, that's actually crossed my mind.": "",
  "Apparently I'm getting pretty good at what I do. I'm developing a craft, connecting with like-minded others...": "",
  "Now that you know all this, could you... maybe... pay her a visit on your own? And spend a lot of money on her?": "",
  "Sure. I guess I should say hi before she quits Apple Pie.": "",
  "You understand me? The only people you should ever show those to is the person you love or your future babies.": "",
  "(I wonder how Ryo is doing.)": "",
  "My brother and I were destined to defeat each other in combat. But that's what forged us into who we are now.": "",
  "I tell you what, though. I'm much more of a man than he is, that little yakuza wannabe!": "",
  "W-Wow, that's... uh... interesting!": "",
  "(Huh. Someone is actually listening to Ryo talk away. Then again, he is paying her...)": "",
  "Yagami-san, head over to Apple Pie on Tenkaichi Street.": "",
  "Please ask for Madoka when you get there. And don't worry, I'll foot the bill.": "",
  "All right, I'll head on over.": "",
  "(I wonder if Ryo is okay.)": "",
  "Yagami-san. It'd be great if you could go to Apple Pie and request Madonkadonk again.": "",
  "She almost has enough money to pay off her tuition.": "",
  "All right then. I'll give her a visit sometime.": "",
  "Hi there.": "",
  "Welcome to Apple Pie. Would you like to request a hostess?": "",
  "Hey there, handsome. If you're looking for someone special, why don't you tag along with me?": "",
  "Or how about me? I give all my guys the <font_kind=yakuza_italic>very best</font_kind> service.": "",
  "Actually, does a girl named Madoka work here?": "",
  "What? You want to request... Madoka-chan?": "",
  "Her? Of all people?": "",
  "Is there some kind of problem?": "",
  "Umm, well, no. But she can be a little... Well, you'll see.": "",
  "So Madoka is available, then?": "",
  "Yes, absolutely. I'll reserve your table right away... But please keep in mind, we don't offer a return policy.": "",
  "I'm sure she'll be just fine. Oh, and put it on Yosuke's tab.": "",
  "I see, so you're with Yosuke-san... Okay, understood.": "",
  "Try not to get too dejected, hun. At least you won't be drinking alone.": "",
  "(What was that all about?)": "",
  "Oh... Hello... Um, I'm Madoka.": "",
  "Hi there. I'm Yagami.": "",
  "I, uh... I guess I'll sit right here?": "",
  "(Man, she's quiet. Guess I'm the one who has to break the ice.)": "",
  "So... Madoka-chan. You seem pretty young to be working here.": "",
  "...Oh, well... Umm... Ahaha...": "",
  "Hey, I know!": "",
  "Why don't you buy us some drinks? Then I might actually tell you how old I am. Maybe.": "",
  "(That was a pretty blunt upsell... Not to mention she's not much for conversation.)": "",
  "So, uh, did you want to order something?": "",
  "(Well, Yosuke-san did say I could order some drinks on the house. Looks like I'm gonna need it.)": "",
  "Yeah, I'll be taking one of these. The 20,000 yen one.": "",
  "Are you sure!? It's 20,000 yen, you know. Four zeros.": "",
  "Yep, I'm sure. Bring me the good stuff.": "",
  "Wow, thank you so much!": "",
  "Ooh... I think I'm tapped out for today...": "",
  "Hmm, you don't look so good...": "",
  "Yeah... Maybe I overdid it.": "",
  "(Damn. Guess my tolerance is slipping...)": "",
  "(...Whoof! That drink could make a buffalo stumble... But! I can still keep going.)": "",
  "(...Argh, this is going nowhere. Why's she still all clammed up?)": "",
  "I'll take another round of that twenty grand.": "",
  "Oh, sure thing! Coming right up!": "",
  "(Whew, this shit's <font_kind=yakuza_italic>strong</font_kind>... Good thing I'm a little bit stronger.)": "",
  "Amazing! You really hold your alcohol well...": "",
  "(Gosh, this is weird. It's like I'm talking to a doll... Not that I would know anything about that.)": "",
  "...Um. Aren't you gonna ask to... you know. <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Do</font_kind> something with me?": "",
  "Something like what?": "",
  "You... do know what kind of club this is, don't you?": "",
  "Yes, but I find it more fun just to talk. Wouldn't you agree?": "",
  "...What? You're actually having fun?": "",
  "Even though you're stuck here... with me?": "",
  "Yeah, so you don't need to worry. I can keep my hands to myself.": "",
  "Oh... Okay. You're a pretty nice guy, you know that?": "",
  "Nah. I'm just not about that life.": "",
  "Huh? Why would you even come here, then?": "",
  "I, uh... Hmm. Maybe I wanted to check out the atmosphere?": "",
  "...You're an odd customer. But I've got to admit, that really turns down the pressure.": "",
  "A-Ahaha. I was only nervous because I thought you were gonna touch me.": "",
  "Ah. So that's why you were so quiet this whole time?": "",
  "Y-Yeah. My heart was hammering so loudly, I could barely hear my own thoughts, let alone focus on talking.": "",
  "Mm. That makes sense...": "",
  "Ehehe. Not that I'm any good at talking to begin with...": "",
  "Can't argue with that. Uh, I mean... What would make you work here even though you don't like talking to people?": "",
  "Well, I thought that if my customers were only interested in groping me, I wouldn't have to worry about being all social.": "",
  "That's... some strategy you got there. But why would you put yourself through that? A nice, young girl like you...": "",
  "*sigh* Well... it's because I'm trying to put myself through school.": "",
  "Ever since my parents back home got sick, I've been paying my own tuition along with all my living expenses.": "",
  "Ah, so you're a student, then?": "",
  "That's right, I'm going to college right now.": "",
  "Mm. Must be difficult handling all that by yourself. Have you tried looking for scholarships?": "",
  "I have, but the only offers I get are student loans. With interest rates like that, I'd never be able to repay them.": ""
